{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/isola-bella-mak-developers-jumeirah-village-circle","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":230,"crm_id":"2862","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"I’Sola Bella","slug":"isola-bella-mak-developers-jumeirah-village-circle","display_address":"Jumeirah Village Circle (JVC)","building_type":["apartment","studio"],"completion_year":"2027","developer":"MAK Developers","price":617948,"display_price":"617K","lattitude":25.0516987,"longitude":55.1997136,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":2,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>I'sola Bella is a 21-storey complex from the developer MAK Developers, where you can enjoy a combination of luxury amenities with the vibrant energy of urban life.</p><p>The complex includes 204 apartments with <strong>1-2 bedrooms and studios.</strong> This magnificent structure combines innovative design and timeless elegance. Inspired by the beautiful island of I'sola Bella in Italy, the complex now adorns the city, bringing a touch of European sophistication to its heart.</p><p>More than 45 amenities are available to residents. Among them you will find a gym, a yoga room, a communal swimming pool, a children's playground, a Jacuzzi, a SPA and sauna, an indoor and outdoor cinema, a barbecue area and many relaxation areas, as well as animal walking areas. The complex is also equipped with a private beach pool.</p><p>The superb location provides unprecedented accessibility to all sought-after destinations.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/I_Sola_Bella_by_MAK_Developers_in_Jumeirah_Village_Circle_JVC_for_Sale_e71bdb2269.jpg","hash":"I_Sola_Bella_by_MAK_Developers_in_Jumeirah_Village_Circle_JVC_for_Sale_e71bdb2269","name":"I’Sola Bella by MAK Developers in Jumeirah Village Circle (JVC) for Sale"},"banner_image":{"ur